<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss announce results of federal bond tender.</title>
<headline>Swiss announce results of federal bond tender.</headline>
<dateline>BERNE 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following terms were</p>
<p>announced by the Swiss Treasury and the Swiss National Bank.</p>
<p>BORROWER - Swiss Government</p>
<p>TRANCHE 1 -</p>
<p> AMT	  314.0 MLN CHF  COUPON    4-1/2   MATURITY 10.Jun.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 fixed-rate     ISS PRICE 106.90  PAY DATE 10.Apr.97</p>
<p> TOTAL BIDS 568 MLN CHF    YIELD  2.217 PCT</p>
<p>LOCAL CODE 615 556  (Fungible with 83157)</p>
<p>--</p>
<p>TRANCHE 2 -</p>
<p>BORROWER - Swiss Government</p>
<p> AMT	  256 MLN CHF   COUPON     4-1/4   MATURITY 06.Jan.14</p>
<p> TYPE	 fixed-rate    ISS PRICE  98.50   PAY DATE 10.Apr.97</p>
<p> TOTAL BIDS 526 MLN CHF   YIELD 4.377 PCT</p>
<p>LOCAL CODE 616 066 (Fungible with 148 008)</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
